arity as a Hanfu (traditional Chinese clothing) experience destination. The area includes the Wenfeng Pagoda and the site of the ancient Jin-Yuan city wall.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Luoyang"},{"id":"luoyang_wv_xiao_jie_tian_fu","areaId":"luoyang","name":"Xiao Jie Tian Fu","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":34.672,"lng":112.4463},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"luoyang_wv_xiao_jie_tian_fu","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["xiaojietianfu","luoyang"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"This \"late-night eatery,\" frequented by locals in Luoyang, is a 24-hour food stall offering a wide variety of affordable snacks. From dan dan noodles to specialty hot pot tripe, the selection is extensive, making it perfect for tourists who want to try a variety of Luoyang delicacies in one go.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Luoyang"}],"sources":["Wikidata (CC0)","Wikimedia Commons (counts; photos credited per file)","Wikipedia (pageviews; summaries CC BY-SA 4.0)","Wikivoyage (listings: hours, prices, descriptions; CC BY-SA 4.0)","OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL): opening hours, fees, websites"]}